{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Management: Disk, File, Firewall, Memory, Network, and Permissions, and related topics.","label":"Management","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/ls","label":"ls","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/ls"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/mint","label":"Mint","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/mint"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWorking notes on Management: Disk, File, Firewall, Memory, Network, and Permissions, and related topics.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Topics<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Disk<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tdf and du for disk space, directory sizes, and finding deleted files that still hold space.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>File<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCheck mode bits, take ownership, and set executable or read permissions.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Firewall<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tBlock an IP by appending a DROP rule on INPUT with iptables.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Memory<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tInspect memory with \/proc\/meminfo, free, top, vmstat, and dmidecode.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Network<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tStatic IP in \/etc\/network\/interfaces, DNS in resolv.conf, networking restart, and ifconfig.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Permissions<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tls -l file types and the owner, group, and other permission bits including setuid, setgid, and sticky.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Date and time<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tView and set timezone, hardware clock, and restart cron after a timezone change.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Uninstall<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPurge a package with apt-get, then autoremove and autoclean leftover files.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Users and groups<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAdd and delete users and groups, passwords, ACLs, and sudoers.d.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Version<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tShow OS and kernel version with release files, lsb_release, \/proc\/version, and uname.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/disk' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management\/disk' data-title='Disk'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/nix\/management\/disk\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Disk<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/file' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management\/file' data-title='File'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/nix\/management\/file\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>File<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/firewall' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management\/firewall' data-title='Firewall'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/nix\/management\/firewall\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Firewall<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\